{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-haiku-5-5", "id": "msg_011Ch1uRT7fRoPQnRD4HA2LL", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "I'm not signing off, because I found a confirmed bug that is still open. Stopping here, with the sweep only partly done.\n\n**Confirmed and filed**\n- **Restoring a trashed photo loses it (missing).** I moved huge.jpg from IrisSeed to Trash, then restored it. The toast said \"1 items restored to gallery\" and Trash became empty, but huge.jpg is gone. The Media filter reads \"Media (1)\", IrisSeed shows \"1 items\", and the state survives a relaunch. The developer confirmed and logged this.\n\n**Filed but not reproduced by the developer**\n- **Albums briefly showed two \"IrisSeed\" cards**, each \"1 items\", after the restore. I reproduced it twice before the relaunch, but the developer could not reproduce it from my steps.\n- **Favorites ignores the Media chip.** With the chip on \"Videos (0)\" and \"No videos found\" on the Media tab, Favorites still showed a photo. The developer could not reproduce it.\n- **\"1 items\" plural wording** on the album card, the Trash row and the restore toast. The developer could not reproduce it, although the text is plainly on screen.\n\n**Checked and looked correct**\n- Favoriting and unfavoriting a photo updates the heart badge and the Favorites grid.\n- The Media chip and the Albums chips keep their selection across tab switches.\n- Rotation keeps Media, Albums and Favorites state.\n- The album card count drops to 1 after a delete, as expected.\n- Search on Favorites finds big.jpg.\n\n**Device state:** huge.jpg is currently missing from the library because of the restore bug, and I can't put it back from the UI. The developer may want to restore it from the seed data before anyone else tests on this device. I also left the Albums \"Apps\" chip reset to All and the Media chip on \"Media\"."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1269, "cache_read_input_tokens": 234843, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1269}, "output_tokens": 4, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "1e139e74-c1d1-4972-a97e-bb958ab22d2c", "uuid": "ddeca6c7-6374-4fc2-af6d-067d06dea51c", "timestamp": "2026-11-14T00:51:51.584Z", "request_id": "req_011Ch1uRSopLaMCNUFDsaGHL"}
